<title>ESTONIA: Estonia payments balance swings to deficit in Q3.</title>
<headline>Estonia payments balance swings to deficit in Q3.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia had a balance of payments deficit of 14.6 million kroons in third quarter 1996, and the current account deficit rose because of a larger trade deficit, the central bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>Figures in millions of kroons unless otherwise stated.</p>
<p> ESTONIAN BALANCE OF PAYMENTS   Q3 1996    Q2 1996    Q3 1995</p>
<p> Balance of payments		-14.6	470.9	332.8</p>
<p> Current account		    -852.5     -705.8     498.2</p>
<p> Trade balance			-3.07 bln  -2.69 bln  -1.62 bln</p>
<p> Services balance		   1.83 bln   1.51 bln    1.64 bln</p>
<p> Income balance		     39.3	 133.5	-23.0</p>
<p> Transfers			    340.0	333.4	499.4</p>
<p> Capital and financial account  580.0	976.3	207.2</p>
<p> Direct investments		 340.7	-122.6     922.6</p>
<p> Portfolio investments	    -432.4     812.4	-409.4</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
